<v Sklar Brothers>我们很好，伙计。你们呢？

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.690
<v Derek Eadon>That's good. Come take a seat. We've got Secretary Castro right here. We're in the middle--
<v Derek Eadon>很好。来坐下。我们有卡斯特罗部长在这里。我们正在——

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:15.350
<v Ira Glass>Castro met the Sklar brothers when they had him on their podcast. The Sklars are identical twins. And important fact about Julián Castro-- he has an identical twin brother, who's also in politics-- Congressman Joaquin Castro.
<v Ira Glass>卡斯特罗在他们的播客上见过斯克拉兄弟。斯克拉兄弟是同卵双胞胎。关于胡利安·卡斯特罗的一个重要事实是——他有一个同卵双胞胎兄弟，他也在从政——众议员华金·卡斯特罗。

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:17.390
<v Sklar Brothers>You were great on our podcast. Thank you so much.
<v Sklar Brothers>你在我们的播客上表现得很棒。非常感谢。

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:18.720
<v Julian Castro>Hey, thanks a lot.
