01:06:37.900 --> 01:06:49.510
<v David Kestenbaum>Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he organized a vote this week about what we should have for lunch as a staff. I don't know. He seemed a little too proud of himself.
